        "text_block_QgKykB": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "description": "<p>The essence of Acoon</p><p>A statement of who you are and who you aspire to be</p><p>Acoon (أكون (is a luxury fashion brand that embodies the essence of \"to be\" and \"to become.\" Acoon stands as a tribute to the modern woman—celebrating her journey, her strength, and her evolving identity. </p><p>Each piece is a carefully crafted statement, designed to empower women to embrace their true selves while stepping confidently into the future they aspire to shape. We believe that fashion is more than an expression of style; it is a reflection of the woman you are today and the one you are becoming</p>"
          }
        },
